# Snowslope Hunter: "Sacrifice another creature or artifact" - the Hunter cannot pay for its own ability. Alone on the
# battlefield (Black Lotus paid for it and is gone) it has nothing else to sacrifice, so the ability is not offered; once Bot1
# casts a Memnite the ability is offered and sacrificing it exiles the top card of Bot1's library (a Forest), which Bot1 may
# play. (CR 118.3, 602.5b.)

